# Rust null block device driver configuration
#

config BLK_DEV_RUST_NULL
	tristate "Rust null block driver (Experimental)"
	depends on RUST && CONFIGFS_FS
	help
	  Builds the Rust benchmark candidate for the null block driver.
	  This option is intended for switchable C/Rust benchmark validation
	  against the C null_blk gold standard and should not be enabled at
	  the same time as BLK_DEV_NULL_BLK in the benchmark harness.

